{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_07",
  "title": "健康零食",
  "storyCode": "DT-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "afd61bcc126580b38ebfefad97e1b6260af625ed39369d0236a4efacb65fc2d0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打、打完了？都解决掉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈......累死我了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈！不错啊小丫头，你那几招真有点意思，老子果然最喜欢术师了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀呀......还好大家没打起来，人都没事就好，人都没事就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，老子今天心情好！带你们去吃老子自己种的玉米！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大哥，你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？......玉米？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刚还在哈哈大笑的拓荒者一骨碌爬了起来，举起武器，对准小队四人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......呼......看来他这是回过神来了，我刚才真的以为他要和我们握手言和呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玛露西尔也抬起法杖，头发随着魔法微微地荡漾起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎？哎？几位这又是怎么回事？怎么又闹起来了？刚还同生共死呢，你们不是和好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克&森西",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玛露西尔，你先别施展魔法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这样吧，大家刚处理完这些东西，都很累了，再打下去没什么好处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们数三声，都放下武器，各自退回原来的地方，承诺今晚互不打扰，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳咳咳！！怎......么......样......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看这位大哥多有诚意啊，都这样了还在坚持！几位看呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大哥，咱们的人也累惨了，再打下去没好处啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......行，三个数，今晚互不打扰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎！真好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三、二、一！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真好......晚上可以睡个安稳觉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Zzz......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玛露西尔？玛露西尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Zzz......嗯？......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！发、发生什么事了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有，玛露西尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们想去看看刚才那些魔物的构造，顺便......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老夫觉得那些东西很像螃蟹，吃起来或许就是宝箱怪的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊，宝箱怪很有嚼头的，而且越嚼越好吃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要你们别再用我的开锁工具去掏肉吃就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是那个真的很好用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "《鲍勃的美食指南》上写了这种东西是可以吃的，味道很鲜美，就是破开外壳有些麻烦！你不想尝尝吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不想！而且被误会成是返回战场准备偷袭的话，说不定还要再打一场！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那些满天乱飞的魔法器具很烦人，那边现在还有不少！我也很累——\n欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吧唧吧唧吧唧......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吧唧......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者&莱欧斯小队",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拓荒者们正往嘴里塞钳兽腿的手僵硬地停住了。\n漫长的静止里只有篝火燃烧的声音。\n噼——啪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来它的钳子里长着这么多肉，怪不得能够支撑起沉重的外壳，还能钳碎那些魔法器具......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是从腹部下刀杀死的，也掀开了后盖，原来如此，看来处理它的方式和处理宝箱怪相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好香！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......尝尝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......咕~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莱欧斯伸手接过了烤好的肉，犹豫了一下，塞进嘴里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯~！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好好吃！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈！老子的手艺......咳！呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你也尝一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯......？真的很有嚼劲！很香欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，给你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？我也有？谢了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烤得恰到好处，没有损失水分，真的和宝箱怪的味道很像！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，吃就完事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吃完嘴巴闭紧，老子还是要外面的名声的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今晚的事谁都别说出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者&莱欧斯小队&瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（为什么你们白天打得你死我活的，现在却坐在这里一起吃烤肉啊？！我根本就没必要赶过来啊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是半夜上厕所路过，什么都没看到啊哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*俚语*算了......过来吧！你给我们送药，老子心里记着的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这事就，就这么算了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不行，不能这么算了！老子的粮仓啊！你们为什么要炸老子的粮仓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "才没有！是你们的魔法器具先攻击我们，我们为了自卫才被迫反击的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魔、魔法器具？你管无人机叫这个？它们都疯了，哪还听我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸......可是你们还从村子里面跑出来攻击我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们要来抢我们的物资啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪有这种事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "停停停，我算是听明白了！这就是一场误会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们的无人机失控炸了他们，他们以为你们要攻击他们，你们又以为他们要趁着天灾抢你们的东西——都是误会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
